%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 02c324f8b87d4d1b853ee79d3921098e, type: 3}
  m_Name: GlobalStoryDatabase
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  Chapters:
  - ChapterId: ch_01
    ChapterTitle: 'Chapter 1: The Awakening'
    Lines:
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4c2cda600e17d3040844d1001b76e26e, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: Look at this place... It used to be the heart of the city. Now, it's
        just memories and dust.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: It looks worse than I imagined, Grandpa. Can we really save it?
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4c2cda600e17d3040844d1001b76e26e, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: With your engineering mind and a bit of hard work? Absolutely. We just
        need to fix it up, piece by piece.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d55d93a88519c914fade87a57e6d4167, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: Oh, please. Spare me the sentimental nonsense.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: Who are you?
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d55d93a88519c914fade87a57e6d4167, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: The future owner of this dirt patch. I'm Isabella. I build shopping malls,
        not fairy tales. Sell it to me now while it still has a penny of value.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: Not for sale. Watch me bring this street back to life.
      IsPausePoint: 1
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3c6097a127f17d3458d258f406b59bdd, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: Hey! If you're serious about fixing this place, my coffee machine is
        barely breathing.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: Let me check the pressure valves. It's a simple thermodynamics problem.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3c6097a127f17d3458d258f406b59bdd, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: Thermodynamics? I just thought it needed a good scrub!
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: I'm on it. Let's merge some tools and get it running!
      IsPausePoint: 1
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0d57fad9c41be454097b69c8b078d26f, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: Hold on! You can't just start construction without proper municipal permits!
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: I checked the city zoning laws, Mayor. Everything is strictly legal.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0d57fad9c41be454097b69c8b078d26f, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: We'll see about that. I have my eyes on you.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d55d93a88519c914fade87a57e6d4167, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: Don't worry, Thomas. They'll run out of money by tomorrow.
      IsPausePoint: 1
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a81aeb2f90c933f419f5beb2984e207f, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: Delivery! Wow, the street is already looking a bit cleaner. Need me to
        run some orders?
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: Exactly, Max. The more orders we complete, the more capital we generate.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4c2cda600e17d3040844d1001b76e26e, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: Make sure you track those logistics, kid. Efficient routing is key.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a81aeb2f90c933f419f5beb2984e207f, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: Consider it done! I'm the fastest courier in town.
      IsPausePoint: 1
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3c6097a127f17d3458d258f406b59bdd, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: People are actually sitting at my tables again. I can't believe this.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: We need to optimize the seating arrangement for maximum throughput.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3c6097a127f17d3458d258f406b59bdd, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: Haha, just don't turn my cozy cafe into a factory assembly line!
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: This is just the beginning. Let's upgrade the exterior next.
      IsPausePoint: 1
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4c2cda600e17d3040844d1001b76e26e, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: You did it. The first major milestone. The district is finally breathing
        again.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d55d93a88519c914fade87a57e6d4167, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: Beginner's luck. One decent building doesn't make a profitable district.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4c2cda600e17d3040844d1001b76e26e, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: Luck has nothing to do with solid structural integrity, Isabella.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: Then you better sit back and watch, Isabella.
      IsPausePoint: 1
  - ChapterId: ch_02
    ChapterTitle: 'Chapter 2: Cultural Resistance'
    Lines:
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 021ea8cb1d1bb964cb0ef1f3352e2b09, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: Excuse me? If you're the one fixing things up, my bakery roof is leaking
        right onto the dough.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: A bakery? Fresh bread is exactly what this street needs to attract more
        foot traffic.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4c2cda600e17d3040844d1001b76e26e, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: Water damage is no joke. Let's patch that up with industrial sealant.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 021ea8cb1d1bb964cb0ef1f3352e2b09, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: I have the recipes, you bring the tools. Let's do this!
      IsPausePoint: 1
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0d57fad9c41be454097b69c8b078d26f, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: I'm receiving noise complaints regarding your construction activities.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: During legal working hours? That's impossible, Mayor. Our decibel levels
        are compliant.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4c2cda600e17d3040844d1001b76e26e, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: Someone must be filing fake reports to slow us down.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0d57fad9c41be454097b69c8b078d26f, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: Just... keep it down. The city council is watching.
      IsPausePoint: 1
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d55d93a88519c914fade87a57e6d4167, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: I heard you're helping the bakery. I could just open a mega-supermarket
        across the street and crush her prices.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: People prefer quality and community over cheap, mass-produced junk.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4c2cda600e17d3040844d1001b76e26e, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: Corporate bread tastes like cardboard anyway.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d55d93a88519c914fade87a57e6d4167, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: We'll see what their wallets prefer.
      IsPausePoint: 1
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 021ea8cb1d1bb964cb0ef1f3352e2b09, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: The new ovens are incredible! We just sold out of our morning batch.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a81aeb2f90c933f419f5beb2984e207f, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: And I've been delivering pastries to the uptown offices. Everyone is
        talking about this place!
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3c6097a127f17d3458d258f406b59bdd, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: My coffee sales have doubled thanks to those croissants, Mia!
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: Great job, team. Let's keep the momentum going.
      IsPausePoint: 1
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4c2cda600e17d3040844d1001b76e26e, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: The valuation of the neighborhood just spiked. I haven't seen numbers
        like this since the 90s.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: We are stabilizing the local economy block by block.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4c2cda600e17d3040844d1001b76e26e, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: It's a beautiful algorithm, kid. Hard work equals success.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: The higher the value, the harder it is for Isabella to buy us out.
      IsPausePoint: 1
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d55d93a88519c914fade87a57e6d4167, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: I must admit, you are slightly more annoying than I anticipated.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0d57fad9c41be454097b69c8b078d26f, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: Isabella, my investors are getting anxious. You said this would be a
        quick acquisition!
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d55d93a88519c914fade87a57e6d4167, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: Keep your investors in line, Thomas. I will handle these amateurs.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: Looks like your little alliance is cracking. Better get used to losing.
      IsPausePoint: 1
  - ChapterId: ch_03
    ChapterTitle: 'Chapter 3: Blossoming Economy'
    Lines:
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e5b15f1aa1ee81c48934725c96562ec3, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: Hi there... I was wondering if you could help me too. My flower shop's
        greenhouse is completely shattered.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: A greenhouse requires precise climate control systems. I can engineer
        that for you.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4c2cda600e17d3040844d1001b76e26e, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: We'll need to calibrate the humidity sensors properly.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e5b15f1aa1ee81c48934725c96562ec3, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: Oh, thank you! The street needs some color and life.
      IsPausePoint: 1
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d55d93a88519c914fade87a57e6d4167, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: Flowers? Really? You are trying to fight a multi-million dollar corporate
        takeover with daisies?
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: It's about the ecosystem, Isabella. Aesthetics drive customer retention.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d55d93a88519c914fade87a57e6d4167, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: Aesthetics don't pay property taxes. My malls do.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: Watch the foot traffic metrics over the next week. You'll be surprised.
      IsPausePoint: 1
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a81aeb2f90c933f419f5beb2984e207f, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: I can barely keep up with the deliveries! Coffee, pastries, and now floral
        arrangements!
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3c6097a127f17d3458d258f406b59bdd, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: We need to upgrade the delivery logistics. The grid is getting busy.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4c2cda600e17d3040844d1001b76e26e, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: A central dispatch hub should solve the routing latency.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: I'll handle the resource management. You guys focus on production.
      IsPausePoint: 1
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0d57fad9c41be454097b69c8b078d26f, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: I am sending a health and safety inspector. Your 'botanical experiment'
        might be a bio-hazard.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: We use fully organic, closed-loop irrigation. There are no hazards.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4c2cda600e17d3040844d1001b76e26e, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: He's just fishing for an excuse to shut us down.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: Send whoever you want. Our systems are flawless.
      IsPausePoint: 1
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e5b15f1aa1ee81c48934725c96562ec3, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: The inspector was actually impressed! He even bought a bouquet for his
        wife!
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4c2cda600e17d3040844d1001b76e26e, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: Haha! That's how you win them over. By being undeniably good.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3c6097a127f17d3458d258f406b59bdd, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: And he grabbed a latte on the way out! The synergy is real.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: We are becoming a self-sustaining economy. This is perfect.
      IsPausePoint: 1
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d55d93a88519c914fade87a57e6d4167, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: Fine. You've won the lower district. But the real real-estate war is
        just starting.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: We are not backing down. We are expanding.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d55d93a88519c914fade87a57e6d4167, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: My zoning lawyers are preparing a massive lawsuit. Be ready.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: Bring it on. Let's see how you handle the heavy industry.
      IsPausePoint: 1
  - ChapterId: ch_04
    ChapterTitle: 'Chapter 4: The Knowledge Hub'
    Lines:
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 72fc4401eb87d01478e0dcee3b99fc9b, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: Welcome. I am Arthur. Sadly, my bookstore is becoming a relic. People
        just don't value physical archives anymore.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: They don't value dust, Arthur. But they do value experience and community.
        We need to modernize your catalog.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 72fc4401eb87d01478e0dcee3b99fc9b, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: Modernize? Are you suggesting we digitize the entire inventory?
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: A digital inventory system paired with classic reading spaces. I like
        how your mind works.
      IsPausePoint: 1
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d55d93a88519c914fade87a57e6d4167, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: A bookstore? How archaic. I was planning to bulldoze this block for a
        multi-level parking garage.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: Knowledge is a high-yield asset, Isabella. A parking garage is just lazy
        real estate.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d55d93a88519c914fade87a57e6d4167, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: Lazy, perhaps. But highly lucrative on a quarterly basis.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: We measure success in generations, not financial quarters.
      IsPausePoint: 1
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0d57fad9c41be454097b69c8b078d26f, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: I must warn you, old paper is a severe fire hazard. I might have to revoke
        your operational license.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: We are installing state-of-the-art thermal suppression systems as we
        speak, Mayor.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0d57fad9c41be454097b69c8b078d26f, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: I will still require a full structural audit by Friday!
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: Try another excuse. The paperwork will be on your desk tomorrow morning.
      IsPausePoint: 1
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a81aeb2f90c933f419f5beb2984e207f, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: Heavy delivery coming through! Books are way heavier than pastries, you
        know.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: We are optimizing the supply chain, Max. I'm building a specialized cargo
        cart for you.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a81aeb2f90c933f419f5beb2984e207f, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: A custom cargo cart? Now that's what I call an upgrade!
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: Hang in there, the logistics will get smoother.
      IsPausePoint: 1
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 72fc4401eb87d01478e0dcee3b99fc9b, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: The integration is flawless! We have students, researchers, and families
        all sharing this space.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: Cultural valuation is up. We are anchoring the community here.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 72fc4401eb87d01478e0dcee3b99fc9b, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: And the digital index makes finding obscure texts instantaneous!
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: Efficiency meets tradition. It's the perfect formula.
      IsPausePoint: 1
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d55d93a88519c914fade87a57e6d4167, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: Fine, you saved a library. But sentimentality doesn't generate corporate
        revenue.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4c2cda600e17d3040844d1001b76e26e, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: It generates loyalty, Isabella. Something your shareholders know nothing
        about.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d55d93a88519c914fade87a57e6d4167, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: Loyalty can be bought, old man. It's just a matter of price.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: Let's keep expanding. We are building an unbreakable network.
      IsPausePoint: 1
  - ChapterId: ch_05
    ChapterTitle: 'Chapter 5: Culinary Expansion'
    Lines:
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3ae9e6c8038e4b24d98c8353be283c0c, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: Mamma mia! My thermal ovens are losing heat efficiency. I cannot bake
        a proper pizza like this!
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: Heat dissipation is a classic engineering problem, Mario. Let's rebuild
        your kitchen with high-grade materials.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3ae9e6c8038e4b24d98c8353be283c0c, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: High-grade materials? Will it ruin the authentic brick oven flavor?
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: Not at all. If you can fix my kitchen, I will feed this entire street!
      IsPausePoint: 1
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d55d93a88519c914fade87a57e6d4167, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: A local pizza joint? I can open ten fast-food franchises here by tomorrow
        and crush his margins.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: Quality always scales better than cheap quantity.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d55d93a88519c914fade87a57e6d4167, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: My supply chain economics suggest otherwise.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: Your frozen dough can't compete with authentic craftsmanship.
      IsPausePoint: 1
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0d57fad9c41be454097b69c8b078d26f, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: The Board of Health requires strict ventilation standards for commercial
        kitchens.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: Our new HVAC systems exceed city regulations by forty percent, Mayor.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0d57fad9c41be454097b69c8b078d26f, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: I'll have my experts analyze the airflow metrics.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: Check the data yourself. The air is cleaner inside than out.
      IsPausePoint: 1
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a81aeb2f90c933f419f5beb2984e207f, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: Hot pizza delivery protocol active! The new insulated thermal bags you
        designed are amazing!
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: They use a vacuum-seal layer to prevent thermal bleed.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a81aeb2f90c933f419f5beb2984e207f, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: I don't know what that means, but the cheese stays perfectly melted!
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: Delivery radius expanded. We are capturing the uptown market now.
      IsPausePoint: 1
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3ae9e6c8038e4b24d98c8353be283c0c, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: Bellissimo! The lines are out the door! Production efficiency is at maximum
        capacity!
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: Revenue streams are stabilizing.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3ae9e6c8038e4b24d98c8353be283c0c, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: I need to hire more staff just to keep up with the dough prep!
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: This block is practically self-funding now.
      IsPausePoint: 1
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d55d93a88519c914fade87a57e6d4167, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: This is a minor statistical anomaly. People will eventually go back to
        cheap convenience.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4c2cda600e17d3040844d1001b76e26e, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: You clearly don't understand the power of a good slice of pizza, Isabella.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d55d93a88519c914fade87a57e6d4167, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: I understand profit margins. And yours are highly volatile.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: The economic baseline of the street just shifted. We are winning.
      IsPausePoint: 1
  - ChapterId: ch_06
    ChapterTitle: 'Chapter 6: Bespoke Manufacturing'
    Lines:
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4a071e55567759a46a98acfe0dadf45e, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: Hey! I have all these designs for mechanical toys, but my old carving
        tools lack precision.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: We need to transition you from manual labor to automated precision. I'll
        set up some desktop fabrication units.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4a071e55567759a46a98acfe0dadf45e, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: You mean like 3D printers and CNC machines?
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: Exactly. You provide the blueprints, we provide the micro-tolerance hardware.
      IsPausePoint: 1
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d55d93a88519c914fade87a57e6d4167, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: Manufacturing toys locally? Have you lost your mind? Mass production
        in overseas factories is the only profitable way.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: We aren't doing mass production. We are doing bespoke, premium local
        manufacturing.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d55d93a88519c914fade87a57e6d4167, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: Premium local? The overhead costs will devour your profits.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: It's a completely different market tier. People pay for precision and
        art.
      IsPausePoint: 1
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0d57fad9c41be454097b69c8b078d26f, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: Industrial machinery in a commercial zone? I will have to issue a zoning
        violation!
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: These are low-decibel, eco-friendly micro-fabricators, Mayor.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0d57fad9c41be454097b69c8b078d26f, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: They still qualify as manufacturing hardware under sub-section 4B!
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: They draw less power than a commercial espresso machine. Totally compliant.
      IsPausePoint: 1
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a81aeb2f90c933f419f5beb2984e207f, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: These toys are incredible! I'm delivering them to collectors who are
        paying premium prices!
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: High-margin products. Exactly as calculated.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a81aeb2f90c933f419f5beb2984e207f, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: I even got a tip that was higher than the cost of the toy!
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: Good job, Max. Keep those supply routes flowing.
      IsPausePoint: 1
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4a071e55567759a46a98acfe0dadf45e, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: Production output is up 300 percent, and the quality is flawless! The
        kids love them.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: The automated calibration loop is working perfectly then.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4a071e55567759a46a98acfe0dadf45e, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: It's beyond perfect. We are creating heirlooms, not just toys.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: We've officially proven that local innovation can beat corporate outsourcing.
      IsPausePoint: 1
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d55d93a88519c914fade87a57e6d4167, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: This... this doesn't make financial sense. My algorithms predicted you
        would go bankrupt by now.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4c2cda600e17d3040844d1001b76e26e, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: Algorithms can't predict passion, Isabella. You're losing the neighborhood.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d55d93a88519c914fade87a57e6d4167, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: I need to recalibrate my data models. This defies standard economics.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: We are just getting warmed up. The real upgrades are next.
      IsPausePoint: 1
  - ChapterId: ch_07
    ChapterTitle: 'Chapter 7: Haute Couture'
    Lines:
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e972bc04a23d2cb42bc07a3ecee7841c, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: Darling, this street is getting crowded, but my boutique's supply chain
        is a disaster. I cannot weave fast enough.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: Manual weaving is a bottleneck, Chole. We need to integrate automated
        loom systems and smart inventory tracking.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e972bc04a23d2cb42bc07a3ecee7841c, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: Automated elegance? Can machinery truly replicate the human touch?
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: With the right algorithm, it can exceed it. If you can maintain the fabric
        quality, I am completely on board.
      IsPausePoint: 1
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d55d93a88519c914fade87a57e6d4167, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: A high-end boutique in this neighborhood? I was going to replace this
        block with a fast-fashion outlet.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: Fast fashion is environmentally toxic and economically fragile.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d55d93a88519c914fade87a57e6d4167, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: It has a turnaround time of two weeks. It prints money.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: We are building a sustainable premium brand. Value over volume.
      IsPausePoint: 1
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0d57fad9c41be454097b69c8b078d26f, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: Textile manufacturing requires severe waste-water permits. I'm afraid
        I have to halt your operations.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: Our new micro-factories operate on a closed-loop water recycling system,
        Mayor.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0d57fad9c41be454097b69c8b078d26f, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: Closed-loop? I'll need environmental analysts to verify that.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: Zero emissions. The data logs are open-source. Nice try.
      IsPausePoint: 1
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a81aeb2f90c933f419f5beb2984e207f, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: These packages are so fancy! I feel like a VIP courier delivering these
        tailored suits across the city.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: Brand presentation is key, Max.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a81aeb2f90c933f419f5beb2984e207f, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: Even the boxes have a matte finish. Very sleek.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: The delivery experience is part of the product valuation.
      IsPausePoint: 1
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e972bc04a23d2cb42bc07a3ecee7841c, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: Absolutely stunning! The upper-class clients are flocking here. We are
        setting the city's trends!
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: Our demographic reach has expanded to the elites.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e972bc04a23d2cb42bc07a3ecee7841c, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: They are practically begging for our next seasonal line.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: The district's net worth is skyrocketing.
      IsPausePoint: 1
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d55d93a88519c914fade87a57e6d4167, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: My fast-fashion stock is plummeting. People are actually waiting in line
        for your boutique.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4c2cda600e17d3040844d1001b76e26e, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: Quality craftsmanship outlasts cheap trends, Isabella. Always has, always
        will.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d55d93a88519c914fade87a57e6d4167, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: This market is irrational. Consumers should follow the price drops.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: We control the cultural capital now. The real power plays are next.
      IsPausePoint: 1
  - ChapterId: ch_08
    ChapterTitle: 'Chapter 8: The Silver Screen'
    Lines:
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ef51d743b9fa9714881ce33bae70a8ce, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: The art of cinema is dying here. My projectors are ancient, and the acoustics
        are terrible.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: We don't just need new projectors, Victor. We need an acoustic engineering
        overhaul. Total immersion.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ef51d743b9fa9714881ce33bae70a8ce, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: Can we achieve Dolby-level standards in a building this old?
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: If you can engineer a flawless soundscape, I will bring the greatest
        independent films to this screen!
      IsPausePoint: 1
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d55d93a88519c914fade87a57e6d4167, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: An indie cinema? I already signed a contract for a corporate multiplex
        with thirty soulless screens.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: Your multiplex offers noise. We are offering a curated cultural experience.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d55d93a88519c914fade87a57e6d4167, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: We have neon lights and a massive arcade. Teenagers love it.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: We will siphon your audience. Just watch.
      IsPausePoint: 1
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0d57fad9c41be454097b69c8b078d26f, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: Acoustic upgrades? That sounds like a noise pollution violation waiting
        to happen. I'm sending inspectors.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: The theater is fitted with military-grade soundproofing foam.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0d57fad9c41be454097b69c8b078d26f, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: Military-grade? Where did you even source that?
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: It's quieter outside than a library, Mayor. Your inspectors will hear
        nothing.
      IsPausePoint: 1
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a81aeb2f90c933f419f5beb2984e207f, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: Delivering film reels and VIP premier tickets! The whole city wants a
        seat in Victor's theater.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: The routing for physical ticket deliveries must be precise, Max.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a81aeb2f90c933f419f5beb2984e207f, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: Don't worry, my scooter is essentially a rocket now.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: We've established a cultural monopoly. The entertainment sector is officially
        secured.
      IsPausePoint: 1
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ef51d743b9fa9714881ce33bae70a8ce, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: Magnificent! The premiere was entirely sold out. The sound system you
        engineered is breathtaking.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: The bass frequencies resonated exactly as the simulations predicted.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ef51d743b9fa9714881ce33bae70a8ce, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: The critics are already calling us the city's new cinematic heart.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: We are drawing tourists to the district now. The economic loop is reinforcing
        itself.
      IsPausePoint: 1
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d55d93a88519c914fade87a57e6d4167, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: This is impossible. My multiplex is empty. People are choosing your single
        screen over my empire.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4c2cda600e17d3040844d1001b76e26e, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: Because this street has a soul, Isabella. And you can't buy that.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d55d93a88519c914fade87a57e6d4167, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: Everything has a price tag. I just need to find yours.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: We are unstoppable now. Time to secure our digital infrastructure.
      IsPausePoint: 1
  - ChapterId: ch_09
    ChapterTitle: 'Chapter 9: The Digital Frontier'
    Lines:
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f0df9c76a75af9b4ca4ab723203cc247, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: Hey! All these businesses are great, but the local grid can't handle
        the data traffic. We need a mesh network.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: A localized, decentralized server hub. I can design the hardware architecture
        if you write the protocols.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f0df9c76a75af9b4ca4ab723203cc247, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: I'll write a custom peer-to-peer encryption layer to keep our data safe.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: Deal! We are going to turn this street into the smartest block in the
        city.
      IsPausePoint: 1
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d55d93a88519c914fade87a57e6d4167, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: A localized network? No. I control the city's telecom infrastructure.
        You will route your data through my servers.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: Not a chance. We are building an independent grid.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d55d93a88519c914fade87a57e6d4167, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: I can throttle your bandwidth from the mainline. Don't tempt me.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: We use a dedicated fiber-optic backbone. Your data monopoly ends at our
        district borders.
      IsPausePoint: 1
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0d57fad9c41be454097b69c8b078d26f, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: Unauthorized data hubs? This is a cyber-security threat! I am ordering
        a complete shutdown of your network!
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: Our encryption protocols exceed federal standards.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0d57fad9c41be454097b69c8b078d26f, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: I cannot allow rogue data networks to operate under my jurisdiction!
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: Unless you want a lawsuit for suppressing free enterprise, back off.
      IsPausePoint: 1
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a81aeb2f90c933f419f5beb2984e207f, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: Zoe updated my delivery app! The smart-routing algorithm just increased
        my delivery speed by forty percent!
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: System-wide efficiency. Every business on the street is now mathematically
        optimized.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a81aeb2f90c933f419f5beb2984e207f, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: I'm taking corners so fast I barely have time to brake!
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: Just keep the merchandise intact, Max.
      IsPausePoint: 1
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f0df9c76a75af9b4ca4ab723203cc247, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: The servers are online and stable! The entire district is connected,
        lightning fast and completely secure.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: Packet loss is at zero percent. The latency is practically non-existent.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f0df9c76a75af9b4ca4ab723203cc247, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: We just created a digital fortress, didn't we?
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: We have achieved technological independence. The street is officially
        future-proof.
      IsPausePoint: 1
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d55d93a88519c914fade87a57e6d4167, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: You've locked me out of the local grid. My surveillance and data mining
        operations here are blind.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4c2cda600e17d3040844d1001b76e26e, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: You can't exploit what you can't see, Isabella. Checkmate.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d55d93a88519c914fade87a57e6d4167, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: This is a highly illegal blackout. I'll have the FCC on you.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: The foundation is flawless. Now, it's time for the final acquisition.
      IsPausePoint: 1
  - ChapterId: ch_10
    ChapterTitle: 'Chapter 10: The Crown Jewel'
    Lines:
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: daaf67181a4cc9249a7e946315bacbfd, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: I have watched your progress with great interest. But my jewelry requires
        microscopic precision and a vault with unbreachable security.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: We will integrate laser-guided engraving modules and a decentralized
        biometric security grid, Edward.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: daaf67181a4cc9249a7e946315bacbfd, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: Biometric security? Are you sure it can withstand a targeted breach?
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: Total perfection. If you can deliver that level of engineering, my capital
        will anchor this entire district.
      IsPausePoint: 1
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d55d93a88519c914fade87a57e6d4167, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: Edward, be reasonable. I am offering you a blank check. Move your business
        to my new corporate plaza.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: daaf67181a4cc9249a7e946315bacbfd, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: Your plaza lacks soul, Isabella. This street has an ecosystem of brilliance.
        My answer is no.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d55d93a88519c914fade87a57e6d4167, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: You are throwing away a guaranteed global distribution network!
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: The district's integrity is not for sale. We generate our own wealth
        now.
      IsPausePoint: 1
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0d57fad9c41be454097b69c8b078d26f, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: A high-security vault in a commercial zone? I am initiating an emergency
        tax audit on all your businesses!
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: Our financial algorithms are transparent and flawless, Mayor.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0d57fad9c41be454097b69c8b078d26f, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: We will see what the auditors say when they rip through your ledgers!
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: Audit us all you want, you will only find perfection.
      IsPausePoint: 1
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a81aeb2f90c933f419f5beb2984e207f, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: Secured armored delivery protocols are active! I've never carried this
        much value in my life!
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: You are the arteries of this economy, Max.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a81aeb2f90c933f419f5beb2984e207f, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: I feel like a secret agent. This is awesome!
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: The physical assets are finally secured.
      IsPausePoint: 1
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d55d93a88519c914fade87a57e6d4167, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: My board of directors just called. The collective valuation of this street...
        it has surpassed my company's local assets.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: Hostile takeover denied, Isabella. The algorithms predicted you would
        win, but they couldn't calculate community.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d55d93a88519c914fade87a57e6d4167, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: The mathematics... they just don't add up.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: ...You win. I am withdrawing my acquisition bids. This district is yours.
      IsPausePoint: 1
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0d57fad9c41be454097b69c8b078d26f, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: Well, as the Mayor, I always knew this street had potential! I am officially
        declaring it a Protected Innovation Hub!
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: Don't push your luck, Thomas. We built this, not you.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4c2cda600e17d3040844d1001b76e26e, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 0
      Text: Look at this place... Alive, thriving, and unbreakable. You didn't just
        fix buildings, you engineered a legacy.
      IsPausePoint: 0
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56a9d02871d780c47976b8def7cf7bb7, type: 2}
      IsPlayerSide: 1
      Text: We did it, Grandpa. The street is finally ours.
      IsPausePoint: 1
